# stopPrerecording(Player player)
# Flips prerecordingActive[player] false so the playPrerecording tick
# loop bails on its next iteration, then forces Pose back to "standing"
# so any subsequent cruise / navigate doesn't inherit a sneaking pose.
#
# Idempotent: safe to call when no recording is playing. The Pose data
# modify is a no-op on a non-existent mannequin entity (the @e selector
# matches nothing) but won't error.
#
# Note: this does NOT bump tickGen or touch isCruising — those belong
# to the physics path. A mannequin currently mid-cruise should be
# stopped via mannequin::stopCruising instead.

@using mannequin
@fast

@var prerecordingActive[player] = false
@bypass /data modify entity @e[tag=mannequin_{{player.getUniqueId()}},limit=1] Pose set value "standing"
